   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Go to a job search board like Indeed.com or CareerBuilder.com. Search for a project management position in business, health care, engineering, manufacturing, or finance. Read the job description and qualifications. Do an analysis of your resume and the qualifications for the job. Determine the gaps in your education, background, and learning in project management and describe how and where you can obtain the skills you still lack.",
